1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
This marble bridge looks ordinary at noon.
{\fs13}I'm your China Travel Expert

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:06,000
17 arches cross Kunming Lake at the Summer Palace.

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:09,000
But only around the winter solstice does it transform.

4
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:11,500
For about 20 minutes at sunset, all 17 arches glow gold.

5
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:14,000
★ Expert Tip: come in the 2 weeks around Dec 21 — arrive an hour early.

6
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:17,000
Chase the solstice gold, or skip the crowds? You decide.
